      "source": "https://www.traveliowa.com/cities/peterson-iowa/180/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Historic Peterson features two restored 1800 homes and the Block House, the last remaining piece of the Northern Border Brigade Fort system.",
